  "reply": {
    "analysis_type": "paradigm_network",
    "rationale": "Two compositional families are defensible. First, cy3/cy5 form a clear minimal pair in the shared frame cy+NUMBER, with the numerals contributing literal cycle count. Second, p8/p12 form a clear minimal pair in the shared frame p+NUMBER, with the numerals contributing literal pause duration in seconds. By contrast, X/X2/X3 do not support a single productive paradigm: although X recurs, the meanings of X2 and X3 include different extra procedure-specific consequences, so the whole meanings are not predictably compositional from X plus a shared count slot. All remaining symbols lack multi-entry compositional evidence and are kept lexical. Standalone face terms and intensity terms are not promoted to classes because no supported multi-morpheme construction uses them here.",
